{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ\n東北ツアーおわりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福島・仙台・岩手・青森・秋田・山形\nありがとう～～⌒(。∵。)⌒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、\n演出構成がガラリと変わり\n今までのアンダーライブとは\n違った1面をおみせできたんじゃないかなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかな、みんなの反応がきになる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までより誰かがいうんじゃなく\nみんな指摘しあう意識になって\n成長できたかなあと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと1期・2期関係なくMCとか含め\nみんな個性でてたしずっと遠征だったから\nより1層仲が深まった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よねっ？伊織っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己PRコーナーで\n1人ずつダンスやってご当地ワードをセクシーに言う企画があったんだけどその企画がすきだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーでご当地ワード争奪戦を裏で繰り広げてたよ！私これがいいたい！ってのがあって盛り上がってた\\ ♪♪ /"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福島: ど ぶ 汁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮城: \"ひ・な・の・伊達政宗\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩手: か も めの 玉子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森: ジョナゴールド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田: なべっこ遠足"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形: ｷｬｲｰﾝ ウ ド 鈴 木(さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆった✌︎(　˙-˙　)✌︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に東北のパワーを感じました。\nわたしたちにできるのはパフォーマンス、、だからそれでこっちからも元気とかあげれたらいいなって。そして全国ぜーんぶの県にもパワーをあげれたらなって。地元の九州にも。ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ\nありがとぴーす\nまた東北いきたいまた会いましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、\nひなめろさんの応援嬉しかったよ～\nサイリウムとかうちわとかタオルとか\nみーんな発見できたとおもう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃすにもらった\n入浴剤がかわいくって\nいつ使おうかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日\n生のアイドルが好き\nにゲストででます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/26/7618969/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっと生ドル大好きだから\n嬉しいの(｢・ω・)｢ﾐﾃﾈ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}